# Wrecking Ball Arm's "equipped creature has base power and toughness 7/7" is a static ability of the Equipment, a layer 7b
# effect with the timestamp the Equipment got when it became attached (CR 613.7e). Bot1 equips it to Ms. Marvel on turn 3 (7/7),
# then bolts her: her granted ability has the later timestamp (CR 613.7a), so her base power is the hand, one card after the
# draw, while the Arm's toughness 7 stays. Equipping is an ability and not a spell, so it triggers nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan
Wrecking Ball Arm
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

